{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/549820-hero-cycle-or-how-works-hero-beast-relation","id":549820,"title":"Hero Cycle or how works Hero-Beast relation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-11T00:01:05-07:00","id":549820,"title":"Hero Cycle or how works Hero-Beast relation","content":"I've read two first chapters of corebook preview. I've looked quickly also in all book, seeking description of Heroes and Satiety. I still do not get how in terms of story works Begotten relations with Heroes. Here are mine questions, maybe you can guide me in text where are described.<br /> <br /> <b>1.</b> <b><i>How</i> Hero come to be?\u200b <i>When</i>, exactly, Hero is created/summoned to Beast? Are involved some Conditions?<br /> 2. <i>How</i> does particular Hero is related to the individual Beast that made him? Are they connected by the Family of Begotten?<br /> 3. <i>How</i> exactly works Anathema? Where can I find info about them </b>( in text is marked as p.XX in preview )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-11T00:35:05-07:00","id":549859,"title":"","content":"A Hero is most consistently created when the Beast's Soul is Starving or Ravenous for too long and rolls a Dramatic Failure on the Power + Lair - Composure roll against a semi-randomly selected mortal within [Lair] miles of the Beast or their Chambers (or rolls an Exceptional Success and depletes the target's Astral Health) when that mortal has an Integrity of 4 or less, which basically imprints the Hero's Oneiros with the Beast's and Hunger and some of the imagery of its Lair.<br /> <br /> A Hero's innate ability to track Beasts always treats rolls to track the Begotten who &quot;made&quot; them as an exceptional success, and the two Gifts they start with include one associated with the Hunger of their first Beast.<br /> <br /> Also, literally the first thing in the PDF after the title is an extensive Table of Contents.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-11T05:38:04-07:00","id":550000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/549820-hero-cycle-or-how-works-hero-beast-relation?p=549859#post549859\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Hero is most consistently created when the Beast's Soul is Starving or Ravenous for too long and rolls a Dramatic Failure on the Power + Lair - Composure roll against a semi-randomly selected mortal within [Lair] miles of the Beast or their Chambers (or rolls an Exceptional Success and depletes the target's Astral Health) when that mortal has an Integrity of 4 or less, which basically imprints the Hero's Oneiros with the Beast's and Hunger and some of the imagery of its Lair.</div> </div> </div> </div>Where are those rules in preview? Under Conditions?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/549820-hero-cycle-or-how-works-hero-beast-relation?p=549859#post549859\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Hero's innate ability to track Beasts always treats rolls to track the Begotten who &quot;made&quot; them as an exceptional success, and the two Gifts they start with include one associated with the Hunger of their first Beast.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cool, so Ahab always know where his White Whale is. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/549820-hero-cycle-or-how-works-hero-beast-relation?p=549859#post549859\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, literally the first thing in the PDF after the title is an extensive Table of Contents.</div> </div> </div> </div>And I used it - <i>extensively</i>. Looked in all places mantioned in ToC with name &quot;Heroes&quot; or &quot;Satiety&quot;. It's why I asked about page numebers in first post.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-11T05:51:53-07:00","id":550031,"title":"","content":"Hero creation is on page 120 under &quot;Inflicting Nightmares&quot; Heroic tracking and anathema are both in the Hero section, which begins on page 272. Tracking is on page 287, the rules for placing anathemas are on page 288.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-11T05:56:56-07:00","id":550035,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/549820-hero-cycle-or-how-works-hero-beast-relation?p=550031#post550031\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hero creation is on page 120 under &quot;Inflicting Nightmares&quot; Heroic tracking and anathema are both in the Hero section, which begins on page 272. Tracking is on page 287, the rules for placing anathemas are on page 288.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mark to developers of <b>Beast</b> - I think those things should be putted in the sidebar in chapter two, when it's talks about Heroes - just as a point of reference.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-11T07:25:18-07:00","id":550089,"title":"","content":"The first chapters seem to be meant to be just 'fluff' which is why they don't put mechanics there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-11T11:09:40-07:00","id":550364,"title":"","content":"But some short sum-up of Hero mechanics would make much more snes. That why I pointed to the sidebar with only - &quot;Creation of Heroes, page XX, Beast summoning Heroes, page XY&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar